    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "It's our job as normal people to ensure the potential of those misunderstood ones are realized."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "One of the things Blank loves best is saying 'No' to people who think they've got an absolute advantage."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "Only idiots start fights they can't win."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "Oppression. Rule by fear. dictatorships. It's a strange thing. Throughout history, for some reason, the lives of such rulers have always ended in the same way: Assassination by someone who isn't even part of a combat unit."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "Sorry. Our world isn't as nice a place as yours. When it comes to war and killing, we have far more expertise than you do."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "The natural enemy of the strong is the weak, but the natural enemy of the weak is not the strong - it is the ones that are even weaker."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "There is more than one way to win a game. You can win without fighting!"
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "There is no such thing as luck in this world. Rules, prerequisites, psychological states... There are any number of invisible factors that combine to produce an unpredictable, but inevitable result. The winner of each game is decided before it even begins. Chance is never a factor."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "There's no more trusted observer than someone who suspects you."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "They say people can change, but is that really true? If they decide they want to fly, will they grow wings? I don't think so. You don't change yourself, you change how you do things. You have to make your own way. You have to create a way to fly, even while you stay the same."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "Throughout all of history, no wise king has ever forced his army to obey him through oppression. People will only truly fight for what is right. And there is only one thing that is truly right in this world! The one true, unchanging righteousness in the world is... cuteness! Cute makes right! All our needs, desires, and instincts seek cuteness, and it is for cuteness that we will give everything we have! That's just the way men are!"
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "We do not stop playing games because we grow old, we grow old because we stop playing."
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "What kind of king makes his men fight at the front line while he sits behind them relaxing?"
    },
    {
        "character": "Sora",
        "show": "No Game No Life",
        "quote": "Whats the probability of drawing the ace of spades from a deck with no jokers? Normaly it would be 150. But what if its a brand new deck? The position of cards in a new deck are typically identical, so that means if you take out the jokers and draw the card at the very bottom, it's the ace of spades almost 100% of the time. Oh that's right! I didn't say a word about it being a new deck. Rather, you didn't ask. Being in the \"no\" gives you the power to turn the probability of winning from 1.92% to 100%. The more knowledge of a party will be the inevitable victor."
    },
