    {
        "character": "Towa Higurashi",
        "show": "Iden Ehon Zoushi: Hanyou no Yashahime",
        "quote": "I've decided to return to the Feudal Era. If Setsuna and Moroha are from the Feudal era, then the forest I grew up in would also be there. That means I've been raised here but was born in the Feudal Era. I only have gratitude for Papa Sōta for raising someone like me."
    },
